OL,3,APrince William joins royalty and world
OL,4,Aleaders at King Harald's funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes are being paid to King Harald
OL,7,FV after his funeral in Norway's capital
OL,8,FOslo, with the Prince of Wales and
OL,9,Fother European royals among attendees
OL,11,FFlags have been raised from half-mast
OL,12,Fto mark the conclusion of a private
OL,13,Fceremony at Akershus Fortress,
OL,14,Ffollowing a public service at Oslo
OL,15,FCathedral
OL,17,FTens of thousands of people are lining
OL,18,Fthe streets to pay their respects after
OL,19,F13 days of national mourning
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
