OL,3,APrince William joins royalty and world
OL,4,Aleaders at King Harald's funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe late monarch died in August after
OL,7,F35 years on the throne - here's a mini
OL,8,Fprofile of the 89-year-old. His son,
OL,9,FHaakon VIII, has now succeeded him
OL,11,FThe king's casket travelled from the
OL,12,Fcathedral to Akershus Fortress, where
OL,13,Fthe monarch was laid to rest in the
OL,14,Fcrypt of the Palace Chape
OL,16,FPrince William is representing King
OL,17,FCharles while Princess Anne - godmother
OL,18,Fto the new Norwegian king - is in
OL,19,Fattendance but in a private capacity
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
