OL,4,Aleaders at King Harald's funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as European royalty,
OL,7,Finternational figures such as King
OL,8,FAbdullah II of Jordan and Ukraine's
OL,9,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky are at the
OL,10,Ffuneral
